[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"set","variable":1,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我做了一个梦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"梦里，两个小女孩正手牵着手漫步在小岛之上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看上去像是两姐妹的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"姐姐配合着妹妹的步伐和速度。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而妹妹则对着姐姐绽放着无比耀眼的笑颜。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"多么温馨的日常。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是曾经理所当然的光景，美好的回忆，也是无可替代的时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我知道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这，是蓝的记忆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样令人心旷神怡的记忆，反而让人想一直看下去。"},{"op":"set","variable":1,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……呜……呼呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……嗯嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“糟糕……睡着了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"醒过来后，发现病房的窗帘外已经变得很亮。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来我也不知道什么时候就坐在椅子上睡着了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呼……呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍还没醒过来。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……早安。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……早……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1181"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊啊……应该怎么形容现在的景象才好呢……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这一定是许许多多的人梦寐以求的景象吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而……却是我先看到了这一切，忽然有种非常抱歉的感觉。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1180"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"病床上的她，用无比温柔的眼神注视着苍。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"用自己消瘦没有多少力气的手，轻轻地抚摸着苍的头发。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10362"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯……好痒……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10275"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……不是说了吗……叫醒我的时候要吻我……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1182"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……第一次…要温柔点？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯……对……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……真的可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10362"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……当然好了～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“好吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是在问我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不算数，所以OK。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1183"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“是吗，那么阿苍……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10378"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯～……嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“苍……妹……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10375"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10134"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“蓝!!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像是炸开了一样，忽地睁开眼睛抬起了头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“唔呀!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呼哇!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"华丽的撞车……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1186"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“～～～～～～～～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“～～～～～～～～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这再会也太糟糕了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍含着眼泪，摸着撞到的脑袋注视着蓝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而蓝也同样含着眼泪看着苍。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1188"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“阿苍……好疼啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……啊……我不是……在做梦吧……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“蓝……是醒过来了…对吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1185"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“不过，对不起……我还是没能找到你所看见的蝴蝶……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1189"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……蓝……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1190"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“唔唔……要喘不过气了，阿苍……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊啊…………呜呜……呜……蓝……蓝……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我有好多……好多话想和你说……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“一直都很想道歉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过……不过……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“谢谢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“谢谢你……相信我……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“为了我……而一直，一直都……谢谢……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1189"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……不，不是的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……要谢谢的，是我才对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“你才是，为了我吃了很多很多苦吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“我感觉自己好像做了个很长很长的梦……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“但是，那不是梦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“我听到了你的声音。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“都是你挽留住了我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“多亏了你，我才能回来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“谢谢……阿苍。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1185"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“蓝……嘤嘤……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1191"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个人紧紧抱着对方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而在一边看着的我，也不禁有点想哭。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“说起来，也得谢谢你呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……我？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1194"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“我睡梦中听到了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“阿苍总是在说关于你的事。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1195"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“所以我都记住了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“而且，你也保护了阿苍。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“鹰原……羽依里，没错吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，嗯，没错。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吓了一跳……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也知道苍一直在和睡梦中的蓝交谈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但没想到真的有效果。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1194"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“对了，羽依里先生。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“谢谢你一直支持着阿苍。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我只是做了该做的事而已。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“但是，我并不认可你们的交往。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“阿苍可是我重要的妹妹。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“必须是配得上她的人才行。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎――――……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"竟然是个妹控!؟"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“既然蓝这么说，那也没办法了～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉――――……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"――妹妹也紧接着在背后捅刀……"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10153"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过呢，蓝。羽依里可是很好的男生。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10111"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“毕竟是能让我喜欢上的人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1194"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“嗯，我知道。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1195"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“谁让阿苍说起你的时候，总是那么的开心呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1194"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“所以，没办法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1197"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个人又互相靠近后，开始哧哧得笑了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像是想要抓紧时间贴近距离，弥补失去的时间一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呼哇……啊呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“还有很多很多想要说的，但安心下来后突然开始犯困了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“嗯……我也是……还有些……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“羽依里……对不起，我稍微睡……一会儿……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……那我也…睡……呼哇……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“蓝……起床后……继续聊天……吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“嗯……说许多……许多……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“晚安，蓝……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“晚安，阿苍……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“就是这么回事……晚安……羽依里……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“记得……叫我起来……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蓝再次躺在了病床上，开始睡觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍也在同一张床上，拥抱着蓝静静地开始打瞌睡。"},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i740"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在蓝的抚摸之下，苍露出了满足的笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而蓝的睡脸上仿佛也挂着笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蓝手上戴着的有些歪扭的琉璃珠。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍的发饰上装饰着的精美琉璃珠。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个琉璃珠并排在一起，在窗帘缝隙中透出的朝阳照耀下闪闪发光。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"几个小时之后，再次睡醒了的蓝从下午开始接受医生们的检查。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"医生们也非常惊讶蓝毫无征兆的苏醒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人的双亲听闻后也立刻奔到了诊所里，打心底里为蓝的苏醒而高兴。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是由于在病床上睡久了，肌肉的萎缩让她现在还没办法站起来行动。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1182"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，意识却已经很清醒了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对话也没有问题。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而更让医生和双亲惊讶的是，虽然知识多少有些偏颇，但是她也知晓不少在沉睡的10年中所发生的事情。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1180"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“因为阿苍一直在对我说这些事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蓝微笑着说道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍对她说的话，她应该全都记住了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也在一旁亲眼见到过。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1145"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘总有一天。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘要是我能把蓝所欠缺的记忆成功还给她的话……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘要是我说过的这些话，她能记住的话……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘这就不就等于说，其实我们一直是在一起的吗。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘当然，谁也不知道到底会怎么样。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘但我们可是双胞胎，我还是会想要尽可能将所见所闻的东西分享给她的吧。’"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1180"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"10年的时间里，她一直在坚持。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的努力全都没有白费。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍确实将自己的这十年分享给了蓝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，蓝才有现在这样与年龄相符的知识与词汇吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是，呼唤苍的称呼还是和当时一模一样。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1182"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“阿苍就是阿苍。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蓝竖着眉毛强势地说道，看来只有在这点上不肯让步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而苍对这样的蓝――"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也没有任何意见。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"应该说，是无法提出任何意见。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍她――……至今还没有醒过来……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]